  "metadata": {
    "title": "Long context has three separate failure modes",
    "description": "Long-context challenges include unseen positions, quadratic attention memory/compute, and uneven use such as lost in the middle. Position Interpolation rescales positions, ALiBi adds a distance penalty, and ring attention lowers per-device memory without reducing total quadratic FLOPs."
  }
